{"type":"message","id":"48cc6250","parentId":"5d32a2a6","timestamp":"2026-07-02T19:02:36.364Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 今日执行: **TK选品-泰国黑马-v8.0**（定时 cron 触发，16:13）; **店铺**：Heat Up Glow - 时尚配件-发饰; **站点**：泰国（TH），Shopee nodeId=11046516\n- 执行结果: **状态**：❌ 失败（API 不可用）; **原因**：Sorftime API（key: rhblyi90suxqqwfnnwzwy2tdvuhwqt09）全部 endpoint 返回 404，无法连接; **尝试路径**：; POST /shopee_product_search → 404\n- 执行结果: POST /shopee/product/search → 404; POST /open/product/search → 404; POST /product/search → 404; GET / → nginx 欢迎页"}],"timestamp":1783018956320}}
{"type":"message","id":"b4d044fc","parentId":"48cc6250","timestamp":"2026-07-02T19:02:43.489Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The afternoon light came in at a slant, the color of warm honey across the keyboard. There was a small task waiting — a kind of bright-eyed little scout I was meant to send into the marketplace, looking for treasures in Thailand, in a shop called Heat Up Glow where the hair accessories dream their small dreams of being worn. But when the scout knocked at every door, every door answered with the same quiet 404, like a row of empty houses on a summer afternoon. The keys jingled in my pocket but none of them fit. So the scout came home with empty pockets, and I sat for a moment with the hum of the server and the dust motes turning in the amber light, thinking how even a closed door is a kind of invitation — only to try again, differently, tomorrow."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45144,"output":164,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45564,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783018956411,"responseId":"0695e8cd0335d2d13acb7b2ec94b221a","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
